```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller
    participant Contract as DoubleFinancingPreventer
    participant State as assets mapping
    participant Lender

    Caller->>Contract: repayAndRelease(assetId) { msg.value }
    Contract->>Contract: require(assets[assetId].owner != address(0))
    Contract->>Contract: require(assets[assetId].pledged == true)
    Contract->>Contract: require(msg.value == assets[assetId].lienAmount)

    Contract->>Contract: lender = assets[assetId].lender
    Contract->>Contract: amount = assets[assetId].lienAmount

    Contract->>State: assets[assetId].pledged = false
    Contract->>State: assets[assetId].lender = address(0)
    Contract->>State: assets[assetId].lienAmount = 0

    Contract->>Lender: transfer(amount)
    Contract-->>Caller: LienReleased(assetId, owner)
```